[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5820.79, "timestamp": "01:37:00", "text": "嗯哼。你可以获得类似外部的信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5824.109, "timestamp": "01:37:04", "text": "外置采集卡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5827.75, "timestamp": "01:37:07", "text": "把那个东西的一端连接到HDMI接口上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5829.99, "timestamp": "01:37:09", "text": "连接这个东西和另一个东西的电缆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5832.59, "timestamp": "01:37:12", "text": "结束你的电脑或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5837.51, "timestamp": "01:37:17", "text": "通过USB接口，你就能把信号传输到电视上了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5839.07, "timestamp": "01:37:19", "text": "呃，电视"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5843.27, "timestamp": "01:37:23", "text": "屏幕。它会在那里。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5845.669, "timestamp": "01:37:25", "text": "那就直接去做。那样就容易多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5849.35, "timestamp": "01:37:29", "text": "同时，音频也会保留。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5857.27, "timestamp": "01:37:37", "text": "当然。还有，你吃饭了吗？现在已经很晚了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5860.39, "timestamp": "01:37:40", "text": "说实话，我没有。但我认为我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5863.83, "timestamp": "01:37:43", "text": "今天就跳过吧，因为我已经吃过了。我曾"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5865.99, "timestamp": "01:37:45", "text": "我的零食和其他东西都是前段时间买的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5876.95, "timestamp": "01:37:56", "text": "所以我真的很高兴我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5879.27, "timestamp": "01:37:59", "text": "合作等等。"}]